{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24955","headline":"秋夜醉归有感而赋 · 牟融","name":"秋夜醉归有感而赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衔盃谁道易更阑，沈醉归来不自欢。\n惆怅後时孤劒冷，寂寥无寐一灯残。\n竹窗凉雨鸣秋籁，江郭清砧捣夜寒。\n多少客怀消不得，临风搔首浩漫漫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}